---
import type { Locale } from "../data/lang";
import { apkChoices } from "../data/apk-choice";
interface Props { locale: Locale }
const { locale } = Astro.props;
const zh = locale === "zh";
---
<div class="table-wrap apk-choice reveal">
  <h3>{zh ? "按电视系统选择安装包（正式版 v2.0.13）" : "Choose the APK by TV and firmware (official v2.0.13)"}</h3>
  <p>{zh
    ? "标准版文件：Tigris-v2.0.13.apk；兼容守护版文件：Tigris-guard-v2.0.13.apk。Guard 是不声明 HOME 的兼容模式，不代表全部 TCL 必须使用。"
    : "Standard file: Tigris-v2.0.13.apk; Compatibility Guard file: Tigris-guard-v2.0.13.apk. Guard declares no HOME role and is not required by every TCL device."}</p>
  <table>
    <thead><tr><th>{zh ? "电视 / 系统" : "TV / system"}</th><th>{zh ? "选哪个" : "Recommended build"}</th><th>{zh ? "区别与限制" : "Why / limitations"}</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>{apkChoices.map(x => <tr>
      <th scope="row">{zh ? x.zh : x.en}</th>
      <td>{zh ? x.zhBuild : x.enBuild}</td>
      <td>{zh ? x.zhWhy : x.enWhy}</td>
    </tr>)}</tbody>
  </table>
  <p>{zh
    ? "安装成功不等于 Home 接管。先在电视上打开另一个应用再按实体 Home，并测试重启、唤醒、清理内存。本版支持可配置 5/6 图标 Dock 和异步壁纸取帧；其他设备的 HOME 接管效果仍需反馈。"
    : "APK installation is not HOME takeover. Open another app, press the physical Home key and test reboot, wake and memory cleanup. This release supports five/six-icon Dock and asynchronous wallpaper capture. Other TV Home takeover paths still need device feedback."}</p>
</div>
